{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_invitation

    The invitation of a family that is an ambassador of the centre, as another family opens it: who invites them, in a
    small line above; the centre, as the titular in hand; its welcome; the next open acts as a short list, each with its
    day and hours and its button to sign up; and asking for information, in one quiet line. Nothing of the family that
    invites beyond how it signs. The seal of Eguahe goes at the foot, in the frame of the page. Functional until its
    design.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "kicker": "La familia de Leo les invita", "title": "Vengan a conocer el Colegio Los Arces",
        "welcome": "Un colegio pequeño, con patio de árboles.",
        "hasacts": true, "signup": "Apuntarse",
        "acts": [{"name": "Jornada de puertas abiertas", "when": "Sábado, 21 de noviembre, de 10:00 a 13:00",
            "place": "Entrada principal", "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/j.php?t=abc"}],
        "ask": {"text": "O, si les viene mejor, cuéntennos qué buscan y les contestamos.", "button": "Pedir información",
            "url": "/local/oksigeniaeguahe/invita.php?action=pedir"}
    }
}}
<section class="pared compartido-invitacion" aria-labelledby="titulo">
    <div class="compartido-cabeza">
        <p class="antetitulo" dir="auto">{{kicker}}</p>
        <h1 id="titulo" class="mano-titular" dir="auto">{{title}}</h1>
        {{#welcome}}<p class="invitacion-bienvenida" dir="auto">{{welcome}}</p>{{/welcome}}
    </div>
    {{#hasacts}}
    <ul class="invitacion-actos">
        {{#acts}}
        <li class="invitacion-acto">
            <span class="invitacion-acto-que"><b dir="auto">{{name}}</b> <span class="secundario">{{when}}{{#place}} · <span dir="auto">{{place}}</span>{{/place}}</span></span>
            <a class="boton principal" href="{{url}}">{{signup}}</a>
        </li>
        {{/acts}}
    </ul>
    {{/hasacts}}
    {{#ask}}
    <p class="invitacion-pedir"><span>{{text}}</span> <a class="boton secundario" href="{{url}}">{{button}}</a></p>
    {{/ask}}
</section>
